resize 600 420
settle 8
key escape
act New session
settle 3
act Found place
settle 3
type Current-stack place
key enter
wait-status 600 Local rendezvous
act Place status
settle 3
capture 01_founder_listening
record-place 01_founder_listening
key escape
act Export place card
settle 3
type ${EXCHANGE}/writer.place-card.json
key enter
wait-file 600 ${EXCHANGE}/writer.place-card.json.prekey.json
act Invite to place
settle 3
type ${EXCHANGE}/writer.place-card.json.prekey.json
key enter
settle 8
record-place invitation_attempt
capture invitation_attempt
assert omnibar closed
wait-file 600 ${EXCHANGE}/writer.place-card.json.prekey.json.invite.json
act Send place message
settle 3
type hello from founder
key enter
wait-status 1200 Retained history: 0 shared nodes, 2 messages
open ${ORIGIN}/founder-private.html
settle 5
open ${ORIGIN}/shared.html
settle 8
act Toggle live content
settle 15
assert content-live
act Open node in Workbench
settle 8
assert surface content
capture 02_founder_selected_address
act Share focused node
wait-status 600 Retained history: 1 shared nodes, 2 messages
act Save session
settle 5
record-place 03_founder_shared
wait-file 2400 ${CONTROL}/joiner.stopped
act Send place message
settle 3
type while you were away
key enter
wait-status 600 Retained history: 1 shared nodes, 3 messages
record-place 04_absent_authored
wait-file 2400 ${CONTROL}/joiner.returned
wait-status 1200 Retained history: 1 shared nodes, 4 messages
act Export place card
settle 3
type ${EXCHANGE}/reader.place-card.json
key enter
wait-file 1200 ${EXCHANGE}/reader.place-card.json.prekey.json
act Invite to place as reader
settle 3
type ${EXCHANGE}/reader.place-card.json.prekey.json
key enter
wait-file 600 ${EXCHANGE}/reader.place-card.json.prekey.json.invite.json
wait-file 2400 ${CONTROL}/reader.refused
act Send place message
settle 3
type after the reader joined
key enter
wait-status 1200 Retained history: 1 shared nodes, 5 messages
wait-file 2400 ${CONTROL}/guests.stopped
act Save session
settle 8
act Place status
settle 5
record-place 05_founder_final
capture 05_founder_final
